---
import { recruitment } from '../config/event.mjs';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="ah-recruitment ah-section" id="recruitment" aria-labelledby="recruitment-heading">
  <div class="ah-section-heading"><div><span class="ah-kicker">BRING YOUR PERSPECTIVE / 一起创造现场</span><h2 id="recruitment-heading">带来你的经验。<br />也带来新的可能。</h2></div><p>讲座与场次的讲者尚未确定，现开放讲者与赞助合作招募。普通参会无需经过邀请审核。</p></div>
  <div class="ah-recruitment-grid">
    <article id="speaker-recruitment"><span class="ah-feature-number">OPEN CALL / 讲者招募</span><Icon name="share" /><h3>{recruitment.speakers.title}</h3><p>{recruitment.speakers.description}</p><a class="ah-primary" href="#registration" data-recruit="speaker">{recruitment.speakers.ctaLabel}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
    <article id="sponsor-recruitment"><span class="ah-feature-number">MAKE IT POSSIBLE / 赞助招募</span><Icon name="arrow" /><h3>{recruitment.sponsors.title}</h3><p>{recruitment.sponsors.description}</p><a class="ah-primary" href="#registration" data-recruit="sponsor">{recruitment.sponsors.ctaLabel}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
  </div>
  <p class="ah-recruitment-note">讲者内容与场次由筹备团队沟通安排；赞助形式、资源与具体合作另行商议。当前不公布未经确认的讲者、合作品牌、赞助价格或权益。</p>
</section>
